WEBVTT

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.980
We have the target in sight.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.490
Target is in sight.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.600
Hurry with the jump prep!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.410
Course is all clear.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:16.830
Course is all clear.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:20.330
Jump out!

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.640
Hey, hey, Brother…

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.650
Look, something is getting…

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:44.270
what the heck?!
closer!!

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.650
Are you okay, Akane?

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:00.630
You are Mizuhara Ryo-sama, right?

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.020
That’s impossible!

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.550
To wear a kimono…

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.780
Under a jump suit?!

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:42.540
As incompetent as I am,
do not think poorly of me.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:46.450
I’m sorry, I forgot to introduce myself.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:48.800
My name is Masuda Shizuka.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.050
I am Ryo-sama’s fiancée.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.800
What?

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:12.230
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:19.100
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:26.460
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:32.090
and paint them on my heart.

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:34.990
The sweetness

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:40.100
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.550
The time

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:47.980
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:56.110
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.000
float in the wind,

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.880
flowing toward you,

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:03.350
freely.

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:10.170
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:13.800
It’s filling with colors.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:18.800
Pretty Girl of Love and Destiny!
Panic Visit!!

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.140
Get out!

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.210
Eh…? Was I off?

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.140
Off of what?!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.960
I don’t know who you are,

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.690
but you completely destroyed our house,

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.940
and now you’re claiming
you’re my fiancée?!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.350
Cut that crap out!

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:35.470
I’ll blow YOU up!

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:36.940
Brother, calm down!
I’ll blow YOU up!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.400
But, Akane…

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.240
Your guard’s down!

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:44.490
W… What’s this?

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.520
Ryo-sama, you truly are good with Akane-sama.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:51.900
That saved my day.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:52.960
What?

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:56.130
It will explode if you try to force it off.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.130
E… explode?!

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.490
I’m very sorry.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:06.140
Will you at least listen to my story?

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.970
Who are you?!

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:20.360
What are you doing to my place?!

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:22.740
Glare.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.080
Amazing…

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.750
It’s all back to normal…

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.330
By the way, Ryo-sama,

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:43.590
please keep everything you see from now on between only us.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:45.590
Understood?!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.750
Yes.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.070
Well, then…

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.300
VCR…

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.770
Start!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.700
The lively energy of the big city…

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:10.700
But did you know that this country is headed for doom

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:16.210
due to the lack of childbirths?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.910
This is one of many closed elementary schools.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.210
It’s long, so let’s fast forward.
This school is…

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.180
Come on!

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:32.610
Anyway, to fix the childbirth problem,

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:35.450
Congress established the R.T.P. committee,

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:39.190
and a plan for arranged marriages
on the national level was put into action.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.030
National level…

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.400
arranged marriages?!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:44.770
Yes.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:47.160
The government picks a group of
unmarried people of a certain age,

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:49.910
then asks them to marry a
designated person of the opposite sex.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.910
And they forced that on me?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.900
Oh, don’t put it that way.

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.920
You just have one more duty as a citizen.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.050
But what if you don’t obey the order?

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:01.170
Without a doubt,

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:02.910
you’ll be sent to jail.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.160
I’ll be a criminal?!

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:07.930
Ryo-sama! Behind you!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:08.680
Akane!

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:14.680
However, due to the sensitivity
of the issue, they want to test it out.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:16.930
So that’s why…

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.300
Yes!

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:21.050
The world’s best supercomputer

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:24.940
picked you as the best fit to be my spouse.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:27.700
Get out.

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:29.520
Ryo-sama, you’re so mean!

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:32.540
I tried so hard to
explain the situation.

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.400
Stop it!

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.370
Now that I know the reason, I hate it even more!

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:39.130
Watch out, Ryo-sama!

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.300
Are you trying to kill me, you idiot?!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:52.300
Oh, even after saving your life,

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:57.310
you still call your fiancée an idiot?

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:03.150
Now listen up, you idiot!

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:07.310
It may be fine for you,

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:12.740
but I absolutely refuse to be forced into a marriage by someone!

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:15.900
First of all, I don’t know a thing about you!

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:19.790
So we just need to get to know
each other better, starting from now on.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:24.700
I have no intention of getting to know you any better!

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.500
You are so stubborn.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.410
But that’s really attractive too.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:33.340
Also, I’m only 17.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:34.460
I know.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:37.380
I am only a 10th grader – 15 years old.

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:38.750
Same as me!

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.050
That means we can’t be married!

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:44.520
So we’ll start with being engaged.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:48.530
If you’d like, we will move toward a change in the civil laws.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.530
I don’t want that.

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.440
A-Anyway, this is absurd!

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:54.440
It’s unreal!

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.530
Why with you?!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:59.950
Oh, but I’m a super flower of Japanese womanhood,

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.320
so I am ideal as your life partner.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:04.780
People recognize my face as lovely too.

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:05.540
Also,

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:08.450
the places that need to stick out
are sticking out too.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.570
T-True enough…

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:10.550
I’m jealous…

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:14.930
But your character is the
worst kind, you damn trickster…

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:15.790
It’s okay.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.000
Characteristics aren’t visible.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.060
Uh…

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.380
Like I said, I refuse!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:23.300
Oh no!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.300
Please let me stay here for a while.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.100
It’s not too late to decide after we live together,

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:29.050
and get to know each other better.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.610
I said I refuse.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:32.450
Don’t say that.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.790
I am your only fiancée in the world.

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:36.850
Like I could have multiple fiancées!

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:37.990
Either way, I…

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:40.460
Don’t worry about my sleeping space.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:43.440
I brought my own sleeping bag.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:46.030
I just need to use the entrance hall.

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:47.740
Are you trying to change the subject?

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:51.660
If you urge me to sleep in the same bed as you, then I can do that too.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.540
That’s not okay with me!

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:55.230
Oh, you’re so bashful!

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:57.060
That’s not the point here!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.920
You can leave all the house chores to me.

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:02.270
That’s not the point either!

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:03.300
Enough!

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:08.050
Get out of here now!!

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:08.900
No way!!
Get out of here now!!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.780
No way!!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.780
Brother…

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:20.370
Akane, get the phone.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.500
Call 110!
110: The number to call in case of an emergency; equivalent to 9-1-1 in the US

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:23.350
Report this to the police.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:23.790
All right.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:27.290
Ryo-sama…

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.300
Your prank ends right here.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.830
Get out of here now, or get arrested.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.380
Pick one.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:36.450
Brother…

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.060
What’s wrong?

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:40.060
The phone won’t connect.

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:41.460
What?!

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:45.550
…is not in use.

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.220
Please check the number…

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:48.340
What’s going on?!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:54.100
The number you dialed…

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:56.830
Oh boy, what a problem for you, Ryo-sama.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.500
I told you this in the beginning.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:05.780
This is a major national project,

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:08.530
so please keep everything between us.

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:10.080
Okay?

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.800
H-How far will you go with this?

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:29.550
Now, Ryo-sama,

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:32.190
I made all the black suits retreat.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:36.200
Please smile and accept me.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.230
Brother…

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:43.200
What’s going to happen to my brother now?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:47.390
There’s no way to win against people with this much money and authority.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:50.740
I don’t think my brother can hold out.

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:51.970
But…

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.080
But!

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.340
I can’t sit back and let him go to jail!

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:00.030
What will you do, Brother?!

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:02.950
Brother!!!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.730
Fine.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.300
My!

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:11.480
My, my!

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:13.360
So, Ryo-sama…

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:15.280
Now, get up!

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:21.590
You’re really not bashful; you’re the type that acts before you talk.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:24.840
But my heart is not ready if you move so quickly.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.470
Are you serious?!

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:28.420
I’m physically removing you now!

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.920
Brother! But only a coward would do that!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.060
I don’t have a choice, Akane!

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.340
I’m sorry.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.920
But I will get physical too.

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:47.560
Excuse me.

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:53.100
B-Brother…

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:54.320
Brother!

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:57.500
I wish the best for us in the days to come, Ryo-sama.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:04.990
In his fading consciousness, Ryo-sama felt a soft sensation on his cheek.

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:10.080
This is how Ryo-sama’s days of love and trials begin!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.120
To be continued.
To be continued

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.500
To be continued

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.160
The moment came

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:21.160
very much out of the blue.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:26.300
You showed up right in front of me,

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:29.020
then started to change everything.

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:32.850
If my meeting you

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:36.700
is not by fate,

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:42.060
there are no miracles,

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:47.250
even if I search all over the world.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.640
Embracing love,

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:54.570
kissing love,

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:58.500
holding love,

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.840
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:06.830
Please look at me and me alone,

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:10.250
forever.
